WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:0% align:end size:15%
<ruby><rt>kaa.lt</rt></ruby>

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:05.300 
Today, we're doing some student council PR!

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.670 
PR? What are we doing?

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:10.640 
I made some new posters.
We're replacing the old ones.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:11.980 
Huh?

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.010 
Looks like Otori, the guy in charge, isn't here.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.070 
He's in charge of PR, right?

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.890 
Yeah. He just texted me.
He only just woke up.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:20.270 
What a bum.

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:22.230 
Oh, he replied.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:23.800 
(Look at this fried egg)
He's even worse.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:26.490 
Why is he taking his sweet time having breakfast?

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:55.610 
(Even the Student Council Has Its Holes!)

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:59.810 
(Episode 2: Tan the Messiah)

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.750 
(The Swimming Club)
Alright, let's put these up.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:04.730 
(Tea Ceremony Club)
We need to take down the old posters first.

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:05.940 
Got it.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:06.920 
Huh?

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:09.360 
Uh... You mean this old one?

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:10.670 
Yeah...

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:12.860 
(The Student Council Has Me Too!
Tan Otori)

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:15.640 
His ego is seriously overflowing.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.820 
I left it all to him last time.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.540 
But people actually liked it.

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.660 
Sorry, I'm late!

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:24.020 
What's this? Admiring my poster?

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:25.100 
The idiot's here.

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:27.730 
(The Student Council Has Me Too!)
Come on, it's amazing, isn't it?

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.040 
You can almost see it, but not quite!
That's what makes it sexy!

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:32.120 
Wanna play "Guess the Nipple"?

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.050 
(Poke)
Me?!

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:36.110 
This is your punishment for being late.

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:37.720 
So loud...

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.900 
(Working)

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.340 
Tan, don't be so rough.

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:43.690 
You'll damage the wall.

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:44.390 
Tch.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.470 
Oh?

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:47.760 
So walls get the gentle treatment, huh?

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:49.570 
What do you mean?

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:51.060 
Well...

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:54.120 
You're pretty flat yourself, aren't you?

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:57.710 
Flat...

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.560 
Let's move on to the next board.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.050 
(Notice Board Done)

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:04.570 
Ah, finally done.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.360 
That's taken care of.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:07.670 
By the way,

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:09.590 
Ume,

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.420 
which do you prefer, "with" or "without"?

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:13.540 
Huh?

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.980 
Without, I guess...

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:18.900 
Oh! What a coincidence!

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:21.540 
What, are you two talking philosophy now?

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.710 
(After School)

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.080 
Sorry for making you help out.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.480 
Not at all. You sure
you can handle all that?

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.890 
Hey, I'm the president! This is nothing!

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:32.960 
That's reassuring.

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:36.190 
Mizunoe, I've got one more favor to ask.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:37.470 
So you prefer "with" after all?

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:38.850 
What?! No, that's not what I meant!

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.410 
Oh, look at you two hard at work!

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:42.610 
Ms. Hiratsuka!

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:44.800 
(Thud)
Good work! These are for Class 3.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.410 
What are you piling on me?!

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:47.560 
Reports.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.960 
Guess I have no choice.

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:51.260 
So you prefer "with" after all!

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:52.570 
I said that's not it!

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.500 
(Dejected)
I knew it. You're definitely a "with" guy.

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:57.240 
Should I get breast implants?

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.670 
No, no, no.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.610 
Why do you care so much about me anyway?

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:03.220 
I'm just your junior.

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:04.000 
Oh, my!

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:08.160 
(Smile)
Because you're cute, I suppose.

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:09.030 
(Flustered)

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:11.710 
Well, I was only half joking.

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:12.780 
Only half?!

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.470 
Honestly, it's because
you're my first real junior.

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:16.960 
(Today's Pattern)

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.430 
For some reason, younger students
have always been scared of me.

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:22.400 
And Tan is... well, Tan.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:27.140 
So I hope you and I can stay close, Ume.

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:29.770 
O-oh... I see.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.150 
But...

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:33.420 
if you get too carried away,

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:34.660 
(Poke)
You'll be in trouble, okay?

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:35.870 
R-right...

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.480 
Oh! Look at the time.

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.300 
I should get going.
See you tomorrow.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:41.330 
See you.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.570 
She really is scary...

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.780 
Whew!

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:50.760 
That was a great chat!

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:56.320 
I showed some authority while still
coming off as a fun, approachable senior!

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:58.550 
No matter how I look at it,
that was a thousand out of ten!

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:00.390 
Arisu! Dinner's ready!

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:04.650 
The lobster bisque and sole meunière
are getting cold!

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.190 
(Destroyed!)
No...

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:08.310 
(Destroyed!)
Zero points.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.270 
Got a crush on someone?

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.220 
N-No, I don't!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.830 
(Student Council Room)

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.640 
- Good work!
- Good work!

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.150 
We're done! We're done!

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:19.780 
Yeah, good work.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.460 
Huh? President, you're staying late?

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:26.900 
Yeah. I have to finish the Swimming Club's
training camp brochure today.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.100 
They asked me yesterday.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:33.000 
Well, it should only take about an hour.
You guys can head home.

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:35.600 
You even stocked up on fresh coffee.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:36.920 
And you're only staying another hour?

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.870 
(Leans in...)
Are you sure?

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.650 
(Leans in...)
Well, you see...

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:45.310 
I'll have it done by
the time school starts tomorrow.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:46.770 
That's basically all night!

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:49.070 
Why'd you take on so much work?

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:52.730 
They were really struggling.
I couldn't just ignore them...

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:55.560 
Come on, you're taking it all
on yourself again.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.540 
You're always taking on
everyone else's work.

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.750 
I guess that's just like you, President.

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:04.090 
But you didn't have to hide it from us.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:05.880 
W-Well...

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:09.880 
If I'd told you, you would've
felt bad about going home.

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.230 
You're too nice...

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.060 
(Bang)
Oh, then I'm heading home!

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:14.380 
See ya!

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:15.870 
What a scumbag.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.880 
(Everyone Minus One Pitches In)

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.520 
What?! Thirty full-color pages?!

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:22.230 
Why'd they make it so elaborate?

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:24.170 
Well, you see...

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.720 
Apparently they got a new computer
and got a little carried away.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.860 
Then why don't they use it
and do it themselves?

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:32.020 
Well...

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:35.610 
They forgot to plug it in,
so they thought it was broken.

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:38.430 
(Splash!)
Then they actually broke it.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.040 
That's way beyond being bad with computers!

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:41.680 
(Graphics, Content, Editing)
All right, let's get to work!

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:42.950 
(Graphics, Content, Editing)
Yeah!

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:44.800 
For the opening...

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.300 
do people usually just write "Introduction"?

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:50.230 
Hmm, it'd be faster to look it up.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:52.170 
(Does your first time really hurt?
When was your first time?)

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.660 
Oh, the signal's terrible.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.360 
Huh? That's weird.

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:03.980 
I can't come up with an opening at all.

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:05.849 
Um... about getting started...

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:07.510 
(First Time, Flinch)
Um... about getting started...

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:09.750 
Ah! No, not that kind of "first time"!

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:11.520 
(Bang)

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:13.410 
(Bang)
President!

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:19.300 
Whoa, it's getting pretty late.

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:21.480 
(The Student Council Has Me Too! Tan Otori)
Terui, how's it coming along?

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:23.140 
(Bringing You Dreams and Love)
You haven't made any progress!

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:25.300 
Oh, Ume...

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:26.690 
Your eyes are totally dead!

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:29.760 
I don't know why, but looking at
these pictures is making me feel...

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:30.530 
Oh.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.240 
Too much exposure to huge boobs

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.380 
has cut her productivity
down to ten percent.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.720 
(How to Delete)
The President's gone, and Terui's barely alive.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:41.460 
That basically leaves me as
our only fighting force.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.370 
And on top of that,
I barely know this software!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.760 
I only know how to use Word!

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:47.400 
Am I seriously gonna be here all night?

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.340 
Somebody! Anybody!

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:53.180 
(Wink)
Did someone call me?

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:54.100 
You little creep!

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:56.130 
I thought you went home!

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.670 
I just remembered something I wanted to do.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.910 
I'll help out. What are you working on?

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.800 
Uh, the table of contents...

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:05.180 
There. Take a look.

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:07.260 
(Too Shocked And Frustrated To Speak)

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:08.580 
Huh? What's with that creepy look?

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.560 
(30 Minutes Later)

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.420 
W-We actually finished!

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:16.130 
Heh. Piece of cake.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:18.600 
(Pat Pat Pat)
I hate to admit it, but you really saved us.

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:19.770 
(Pat Pat Pat)
Don't mention it.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:22.700 
Of course I'd come running
if a friend was in trouble.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.000 
You...

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:26.010 
Now worship me and sing my prases!

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:27.430 
It's "praises"!

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:28.480 
(For Sale)

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:29.620 
"For sale"?

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.610 
What's this supposed to be?

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:32.950 
Oh, that?

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:35.320 
I just thought of it!

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:39.520 
Why not sell swimsuit photos of
the Swimming Club girls on my fan site?

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:40.560 
What?

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:43.520 
Hey, I'd blur their faces, of course!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.650 
I'm very privacy-conscious!

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:48.770 
The Swimming Club gets their brochure,

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.680 
my fans get to see high school girls in swimsuits,

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:53.980 
and I get paid!

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.700 
I'm a total genius!

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:58.020 
(The Next Day)

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:00.420 
W-Wait! Hold on!

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:02.010 
(100 Yen Per Photo, 10,000 Yen Per Punch)
What the heck is this?

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:04.960 
I had such a brilliant idea!
Why am I the one getting humiliated?

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:06.180 
Exactly!

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.970 
Having people stare at you in a swimsuit
is embarrassing!

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.020 
Maybe use that big brain of yours
to learn some manners!

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:15.650 
The tips went straight
into the Swimming Club's budget.

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:19.070 
Hey, Arisu! I'm bored!

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:21.830 
Yeah, yeah. Just give me a sec.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:26.570 
You want me to help with the night patrol?

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:29.230 
Yeah. There's no one else I can ask.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.040 
She's intense...

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:32.910 
(Disciplinary Committee Member, Yoka Hojo)
(Thud!)

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:33.670 
(Glare!)

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:35.720 
I'll be back as soon as I finish my errand.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:38.580 
An errand? You going
to beat up some punks or something?

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:40.160 
(Mer...)
"Mer..."

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:42.070 
"Mer..."

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.130 
(Mer...)

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:45.949 
There's a merch sale.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:48.560 
(Limited-Edition Poku Poku Macaron)
For Poku Poku Macaron.

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:51.730 
Yoka may look scary and stand 193 cm tall,

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:53.870 
but she absolutely loves cute things!

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:55.550 
- That's adorable!
- So cute!

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:57.470 
(School Front Gate, 8:00 PM)

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.620 
All right, let's start our patrol.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:04.830 
The school really does feel
pretty creepy at night.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.240 
Yeah, it does.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.890 
If you get scared, you can rely on me...

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:08.720 
What?

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.910 
Wait, are you scared?

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:13.120 
Even I'm not scared,
and I'm younger than you!

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:14.910 
I can't help it!

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:17.350 
I've got an overactive imagination!

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:21.140 
Fine, fine. You can rely on me!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.600 
My cuteness can ward off evil, you know!

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.370 
(Evil-Spirit Repellent)
Must be nice being an idiot.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.280 
W-W-What's wrong?!

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:38.240 
Huh? Oh, sorry. I bumped into you.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:41.530 
I wish he'd rely on me too.

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:44.240 
(Now on the Second Floor)
We've come even farther in...

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:46.090 
Oh, speaking of which...

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:52.220 
Ever heard of our school's Seven Mysteries?

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:55.530 
(Flash)
The echo of someone jumping to their death...

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:58.520 
echoing that keeps repeating
in the west building.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:03.140 
The seven-foot-tall apparition
that roams the high school building at night.

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:07.010 
The hanging corpse that never disappears
from Class 2-1.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:12.210 
The thirteen steps in the east building
that curse anyone who climbs them at midnight.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.160 
(Flash)
And then...

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:17.600 
(Flash)
Arisu Terui, Class 2-4.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.470 
(Forgot the Other Two)
That's just a person's name!

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:22.560 
So you really aren't scared
of this stuff, Terui?

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:25.000 
No, not at all...

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:26.300 
Really?

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:29.700 
I'm actually kind of a scaredy-cat.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:33.270 
When I was little, I couldn't sleep
if my daddy wasn't around.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:35.050 
- Oh, really?
- Daddy?

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:38.400 
Daddy! Daddy!
You actually call him "Daddy"!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.270 
What a daddy's girl!

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:42.780 
Don't tell me you still
take baths together!

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:43.890 
Let's go.

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:45.810 
So even she gets scared of something.

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.170 
(Tan Gets Left Behind)

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:49.930 
This must be what Otori
was talking about earlier.

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.650 
The cursed thirteen-step staircase.

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:54.429 
Ume, I'm scared!

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:55.190 
(Squeeze)
Ume, I'm scared!

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:57.600 
(Squeeze)
Yeah, you're definitely not scared.

00:11:57.810 --> 00:12:00.200 
I'm the one who's actually
scared right now!

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:02.290 
- It's just a normal staircase.
- Ow! Ow!

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:03.670 
- Hey.
- My shoulder!

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:05.240 
- Relax.
- Wait!

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:07.080 
- There's nothing to worry about.
- Look at your right hand!

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:09.280 
I want him to rely on me too.

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:10.860 
(Elsewhere on the Third Floor)

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:15.950 
(Sneaking Around to Ambush Them)
How could they ditch someone as cute as me?

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.480 
They deserve a little payback!

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:20.680 
Here's the plan!

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:23.500 
I'll hang my jacket
on the tree outside the window.

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:25.550 
Then, when everyone gets
up to the third floor,

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:28.550 
they'll mistake it for a hanging corpse
and freak out!

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:32.610 
Then I'll swoop in to save them,
and everyone'll be so grateful!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.830 
So this is all about your need for attention?

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:36.830 
It's so far away!

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:38.490 
Just a little farther...

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:40.400 
- Hey!
- Huh?

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:43.500 
Huh?!

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:50.380 
(Flying Into the Night)

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:52.390 
Did you guys hear that scream just now?

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.330 
What was that? Outside?

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:56.910 
Did someone jump...?

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:04.490 
Terui!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:05.480 
Are you okay?

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:08.240 
Wait, what happened?
What's gotten into you?

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:10.610 
Don't tell me you're actually scared!

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:14.080 
I-I told you
I was scared this whole time!

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:15.690 
Th-That's...

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:16.930 
Huh?

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:18.900 
That's...

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:21.790 
A hanging body!

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:23.170 
No, look closer! That's Tan!

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:24.330 
Don't look, President!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.810 
One look at that thing,
and you'll be cursed for sure!

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:30.120 
Kotobuki got exactly what she wanted.

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:35.440 
Sorry.

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:40.759 
After that, Yoka Hojo, the Seven-Foot Lady,
helped get Otori down.

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:41.430 
(Everything's Huge)

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.760 
(193 cm Tall, So She Usually
Wears Her Uniform Even on Days Off)

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:01.710 
It's been forever
since I've been at school.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.249 
I'm so excited!

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:05.250 
(First-Year High School Student,
Komaro Michinoku)

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:11.620 
(Episode 2: Komaro Appears!!)

00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:12.820 
(School, 7:30 AM)

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:14.640 
(School, 7:30 AM)
Man, I'm beat.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:17.420 
I thought the teacher called me in
for something important.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.660 
- Turns out I just had to prep her lessons.
- Make me some cocoa next.

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:21.080 
Make it yourself!

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:24.780 
Well, I'm already here.
Might as well do some student council work.

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:26.730 
Huh?

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:30.610 
Otori forgot to lock up again.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:40.340 
(Locked-Room Murder Mystery)
A murder?!

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:40.920 
(Evidence, Culprit)

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:44.750 
Um, are you okay?

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:48.950 
They're huge!

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:52.690 
So heavy...

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.370 
What's with this girl?

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:56.090 
Guess it wasn't a murder after all.

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:59.020 
No, wait, I was just...

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:02.380 
W-Wait a second!

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:03.860 
What a raspy voice!

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:06.960 
Huh?

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:10.110 
Hair's fine. I look presentable.

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:11.410 
That's what you're worried about?

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.920 
What's with all the blood?

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:15.590 
And who are you, anyway?

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:17.490 
Oh, right. How rude of me.

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:18.810 
It's just a nosebleed.

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:19.820 
(30 Minutes Earlier)

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:21.600 
I got it when a car hit me.

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:23.050 
You got hit by a car?!

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:25.220 
Shouldn't you have led with that?

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:26.340 
That's way more serious!

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:28.960 
Oh, I got the order wrong? Sorry.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.170 
My name's Komaro.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.110 
That's not what I meant!

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:37.810 
Wait, you're on the Student Council too?

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:40.390 
Yep. General Affairs.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.100 
(First-Year High School Student, General Affairs
Komaro Michinoku)

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:46.300 
I've been out for about a month
because of an injury.

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:48.310 
O-Oh, I see.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.860 
Poor thing...

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:53.580 
(Hehe...)
I come back and I've got a junior! I'm so happy!

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.700 
She's so modest, too.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:57.120 
A little weird, though.

00:15:57.230 --> 00:16:00.240 
Oh, right. I should probably get to work.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:01.690 
General Affairs work?

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.020 
Wow, she's tiny when she stands up.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:06.190 
Yep! I've got tons to do! Watch!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:12.220 
Like picking things up off the floor!

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.050 
Oh. Impressive.

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:18.890 
- Like a stray cat getting its first kibble.
- Gotta get these before they get stepped on!

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:19.820 
What?

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:20.930 
Oh, nothing!

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:24.810 
I was just thinking it's amazing how hard
you're working right after getting hurt.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.870 
Uh, well...

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.830 
I should probably get some work done too.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:34.400 
Huh?

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:36.270 
W-What's wrong?

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:38.110 
Hey, Ume, you're the secretary?

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:39.370 
Yeah, I am.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.610 
I actually wanted to be the secretary.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:44.460 
But they wouldn't let me.

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:47.850 
So I wanna see what a secretary does up close!

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.250 
Can I?

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.940 
Uh, yeah, of course!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.720 
Where'd all this enthusiasm come from?

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:54.060 
Then...

00:16:59.040 --> 00:16:59.840 
Uh...

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:01.490 
H-Hold on a second!

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:02.920 
Come on, hurry!

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:05.850 
Does this say "but"?

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:08.400 
- Oh, never mind.
- No, it says "however."

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:10.770 
(First-Year, Class 2)

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.970 
(Tiny)
Well, Michinoku, who was absent,

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:14.840 
(Tiny)
is finally back with us.

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.680 
Make her feel welcome, everyone.

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:18.300 
We're in the same class?!

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:20.590 
Take the seat behind Mizunoe.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:21.630 
(130-Yen Bread, Split Between Two Meals)

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.470 
(Hand Plate: Bad Manners.
Boob Plate: Good Manners.)

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:26.590 
(Student Council Room)

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.980 
So, anyway...

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.390 
Koma from General Affairs is back!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:32.830 
By the way,

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:35.730 
when did you two get so close?

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:39.510 
We just happened to run into each other
this morning.

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:40.920 
We're besties now!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:43.360 
Seeing you two like this kinda ticks me off.

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:44.380 
I see.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:45.680 
How nice!

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:49.470 
Anyway, I'm glad Koma's back with us.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.780 
Yeah, me too.

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:52.290 
Quit clinging to me!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.230 
Since Koma's in General Affairs,

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:57.910 
her work will probably overlap with
Mizunoe's quite a bit.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:58.870 
Yeah.

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:00.020 
I'll show him the ropes...

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.250 
Make sure you show her the ropes, Mizunoe.

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:03.720 
I know!

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:04.780 
Oh, sorry.

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:08.340 
Koma's actually your senior
on the Student Council.

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:10.530 
So that's how everyone treats her.

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:13.830 
Come to think of it, why is Michinoku
in General Affairs?

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.400 
I heard she wanted to be secretary.

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:16.830 
Want a snack?

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:18.450 
Well, about that...

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:24.360 
I worked so hard on
those super-important papers!

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:26.000 
Well, General Affairs

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:27.900 
- doesn't handle much important stuff.
- Wipe that up, now!

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:30.010 
Okay, I think I get it now.

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:34.080 
Oh, hello! Koma, you're back!

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.510 
Oh, my!

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.250 
H-Hello!

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:40.100 
(Gloom)
You're doing that at school?

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:41.410 
We're not!

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:44.000 
Oh, so I got the wrong idea?

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:46.380 
With Koma, I thought maybe...

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:48.070 
My apologies!

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:50.240 
What kind of girl do you think she is?

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:54.750 
This girl has absolutely no guard
around anyone.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:59.680 
She's like a kakapo,
too friendly for its own good!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.680 
A kakapo?

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:02.360 
Wanna see for yourself?

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:02.970 
Huh?

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.530 
There!

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.730 
See? No resistance at all!

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:09.110 
She needs protecting!

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:11.830 
No one but you would do that!

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:13.940 
Oh, Koma!

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:16.730 
If someone grabs your boobs,
you gotta get mad and tell them no!

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:17.890 
Look who's talking!

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.780 
Oh, right...

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:22.300 
If you don't like it, you have to say so,

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:25.210 
or some creep might do something awful to you!

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:26.960 
U-Um, but...

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:30.020 
I didn't mind what you did just now,

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:31.250 
so I guess it's okay...

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:32.580 
Aww!

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:34.090 
See what I mean?

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:36.580 
She's so clueless, it's adorable!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:38.920 
She really does treat her like an animal.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:42.750 
You've been going on and on
about how cute she is.

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:45.020 
But seriously, how cute is she really?

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:46.300 
What do you mean?

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.470 
I'm saying...

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.050 
between clumsy little Koma

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:51.570 
and super-capable,
go-getter me,

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:54.240 
who's cuter?

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:56.070 
Michinoku, obviously.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.050 
Objectively? Koma, of course.

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:00.410 
What?

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:03.330 
(Komaro is right here)
Sorry our first meeting got so chaotic.

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:05.970 
Don't worry. It's always like this.

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:10.440 
By the way, Koma, have you said hi
to Ms. Hiratsuka yet?

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:13.270 
Yeah! She said she was glad
I was back.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:14.030 
Huh?

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:17.260 
Michinoku, you're close with Ms. Hiratsuka?

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.120 
Didn't you transfer here in high school?

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:21.830 
Yeah, but we met back in middle school.

00:20:22.140 --> 00:20:25.870 
I was watching her catch bugs in the park,
and she started talking to me.

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:28.600 
A 29-year-old single woman...

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:31.780 
You're close with her too, Ume!

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:33.830 
She talks about you sometimes.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.470 
Huh? Really?

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:38.220 
She says you're a Japanese whiz
who's hopeless at math and science.

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:39.330 
That woman...

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:42.330 
Well... she's not wrong.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:44.670 
Does your stomach hurt?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.950 
Aw, you all get along so well!

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:52.670 
Well, those two joined the Student Council
on their teacher's recommendation.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:54.990 
Wait, Michinoku too?

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:56.770 
Yep, that's right.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:21:00.230 
She came to me directly and asked me
to help out a student who was struggling.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:01.450 
There was a lot going on.

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:02.680 
Oh, I see.

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:06.390 
Back then, Koma seemed pretty bad
at talking to people.

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:09.040 
But now she's opened up so quickly.

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:11.490 
Maybe Ms. Hiratsuka knew

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:14.470 
things would turn out this way.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.330 
Huh?

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.140 
You're in the same year,

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.390 
and even in the same class, right?

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:22.620 
You'd be the perfect match for Koma.

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:24.640 
Match?

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:28.710 
From what I've seen,
you are a really good match.

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:31.900 
So good I'm almost jealous!

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:32.900 
No, that's not...

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:34.540 
No, really!

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:36.660 
I'm so happy!

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:38.870 
What's with that face
you've been making this whole time?

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:40.600 
Why are you crying?

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:43.120 
And what's all this about us clicking?

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.850 
Is this snot?

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:47.730 
It's coming out of your eyes!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:51.280 
There, there.

00:21:51.360 --> 00:21:53.550 
You thought someone had stolen Ume away, huh?

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:55.160 
You've got it all wrong!

00:21:56.360 --> 00:21:58.590 
Turns out Kotobuki's the clingy type.

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:02.540 
I'm most grateful to you, President.

00:22:02.570 --> 00:22:03.410 
Huh?

00:23:27.230 --> 00:23:34.780 
(Even the Student Council Has Its Holes!)

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:35.970 
(Next Episode Preview)

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:40.040 
(Pool Cleaning in Swimsuits! What a Relief.)
(More Student Council Next Time ♪)